he airline\'s deep appreciation in an open letter on X, to its customers and staff who went through an unprecedented operational crisis\nTitle: The State of Aviation 2025 - Travel | McKinsey & Company\nURL: https://www.mckinsey.com/industries/travel/our-insights/the-state-of-aviation\nContent: Explore the 2025 aviation industry outlook with expert insights, key trends, and in-depth analysis of airline profitability, business models, and market shifts.\n\n## Results for query: are airlines operating normally after disruptions\nTitle: Airlines operations return to normal after systems restored from IT ...\nURL: https://www.business-standard.com/industry/news/airlines-operations-return-to-normal-after-systems-restored-from-it-outage-124072000821_1.html\nContent: Airlines operations across airports, which were impacted due to a global IT outage on Friday, returned to normalcy on Saturday with all services from ticket bookings to reservations and issuing of boarding passes going back completely to the online mode, sources said.\nTitle: Which airports and airlines have been affected by the outages?\nURL: https://www.accuweather.com/en/weather-news/which-airports-and-airlines-have-been-affected-by-the-outages/1670856\nContent: Dubai International Airport Officials at Dubai International Airport say that the check-in process for some airlines had been affected, but that it is "now back to operating normally."\nTitle: Microsoft outage causes widespread airline disruptions and ...\nURL: https://www.cbsnews.com/news/microsoft-outage-crowdstrike-airlines-delta-american-united/\nContent: Air travel is experiencing disruptions across the globe on Friday morning due to a Microsoft outage for customers of its 365 apps, including many major airlines.\nTitle: American Airlines operations returning to normal after widespread ...\nURL: https://www.cnn.com/2025/06/27/us/american-airlines-outage-friday\nContent: American Airlines suffered a widespread outage with its flight information computer system, authorities with two affected airports told CNN.\nTitle: Live updates: After massive IT outage for airlines and health ... - MSN\nURL: https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/technology/live-updates-major-u-s-air-carriers-ground-flights-as-mass-it-outage-hits-windows-users/ar-BB1qg3iM\nContent: The disruptions to hospital patients in the United States and globally are revealing how a simple software update can cripple health-care organizations that rely on widely deployed digital systems.\n\n## Results for query: flights resumed after recent disruptions news\nTitle: Qatar reopens airspace — the latest on flight cancellations and disruptions\nURL: https://www.cntravellerme.com/story/qatar-reopens-airspace-the-latest-on-flight-cancellations-and-disruptions\nContent: The airspace closure was lifted in the early hours of Tuesday morning, with Qatar officials announcing flights could resume as normal and thanking all partners for their cooperation during the closure. Qatar Airways warns of \'significant delays\' However, the closure is still having a knock-on effect on flights, as dozens of aircraft were diverted to airports across the region on Monday\nTitle: American Airlines resumes flights after technical issue\nURL: https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cd0eyd9pgvyo\nContent: American Airlines has resumed flights after suspending its services for around an hour on Tuesday due to a technical issue that impacted the systems needed to release its planes.\nTitle: 2,600+ US flights canceled: United, American Airlines resume service ...\nURL: https://www.usatoday.com/story/travel/news/2024/07/19/global-it-outage-flights-canceled-delayed/74466125007/\nContent: Most airlines were able to resume operations as the morning progressed, but many said they expected disruptions to continue throughout the day.\nTitle: US strikes on Iran add to global travel disruptions and flight ...\nURL: https://apnews.com/article/iran-travel-air-flights-cancellations-34a75a4aa1d402465e988c610